--- doc/info.n
+++ doc/info.n
@@ -39,10 +39,13 @@
 .\" METHOD: cmdcount
 .TP
 \fBinfo cmdcount\fR
 .
 Returns the total number of commands evaluated in this interpreter.
+The count is approximate: when bytecode is compiled for an interpreter
+without command or time limits, commands that are compiled inline (such as
+\fBset\fR or \fBincr\fR) may not be counted.
 .\" METHOD: cmdtype
 .TP
 \fBinfo cmdtype \fIcommandName\fR
 .VS TIP426
 Returns a the type of the command named \fIcommandName\fR.

